This repository holds four kinds of material under three different licences.
The MIT text below covers the code alone. The other three are stated in full in
README.md, section "Licensing", and are summarised here:

  Code: build.py, templates/, cv/cv.tex.j2 and the stylesheets under
  static/css/, under the MIT licence printed below.

  Text and data: the prose of the site, the YAML corpus under data/ and both CV
  PDFs, under CC BY 4.0.

  Teaching materials: the slide decks under static/teaching/, under
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

  Third-party assets, under their own terms: the footer sprites under
  static/img/, from PMD Collab's SpriteCollab archive under CC BY-NC 4.0,
  depicting characters that are trademarks of Nintendo, Creatures and Game
  Freak; the Academicons glyphs inlined in templates/partials/icons.html.j2,
  under SIL OFL 1.1 for the artwork and MIT for the code; and the typefaces
  under static/fonts/ and cv/fonts/, under SIL OFL 1.1.

